window.products.push({"id":186254,"name":"Wolizom Portable 12-Cube Storage Organizer - 14\" × 14\" Closet Shelves with Doors, Modular Storage Shelves, DIY Plastic Bookshelf Cabinet for Bedroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f32D6zL5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ample Capacity: Each of cube storage is 14＂L × 14＂W × 14＂H. The product measures41＂L × 14＂W × 56＂H. You can store as many items as you want to keep your room organized Durable and Stable: Multifunctional storage box is made of durable PP material, rust-proof metal frame and ABS connectors, when you assemble it with plastic hammer to fix panels and connectors, it will be stable, not easy to bend and shape, Note that cubes can hold up to 10 lbs DIY Design: This portable DIY cube storage has multiple ways to stack, you can freely decide the shape of the bookcase, not only can be used alone assembled, but also multiple compartments can be used to create more storage space for you Multifunctional Shelf: This plastic cube closet organizer can store clothes, books, sundries, yarn, shoes children's toys, It is widely used in bedrooms, living rooms, bathrooms, study rooms, kid's rooms, utility rooms, entryway and wardrobe interiors, etc. Easy to Assemble and Disassemble: Please read the instructions carefully before assembly. It's a simple modular structure, simply insert the panels into the slots of connectors, then tap with the included plastic hammer, you can easily assemble this shelf 100% Satisfaction Service: We provide 7/24 uninterrupted customer service, you can always contact us if you have any questions. You just need to buy and enjoy it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81f32D6zL5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wolizom","source_asin":"B09NBMHJTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBMHJTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBMHJTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186255,"name":"Set of 10 Rectangle Refrigerator Magnet Sublimation Blanks! Satin Finish.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xCk7y5OvL._AC_.jpg","description":"YOU WILL GET 10! Now in our elegant signature satin finish. These are TWO PART Rectangle Shaped Refrigerator Magnet Sublimation Blanks. You get the MDF hardboard rectangle and you also get a rectangle shape self adhesive magnet you put on AFTER you sublimate. You will receive 10 of the MDF hardboard rectangles and 10 rectangle self adhesive magnet backs. These are in a gorgeous satin finish that does not produce glare like all the glossy ones you see for sale. Why is this better? Many companies will sell you a 1-piece MDF/magnet back combo already attached together. The problem with this is that when you heat a magnet, it loses its strength and can often de-magnetize. We prefer 2 separate parts so you can just easily place your magnet on like a self adhesive sticker AFTER you heat press your square has cooled. - 2 3/4\" x 2\" - soft satin finish - 2 parts: Hardboard square and a self-adhesive magnet you add on after you sublimate - FRONT SIDE HAS A PROTECTIVE FILM YOU MUST REMOVE BEFORE YOU SUBLIMATE Directions to sublimate: Remove the protective film on the front of your magnet before you sublimate Make your artwork at least 1/4\" wider than you magnet Heat tape your art to your magnet Cover your artwork with butcher paper 380 degrees for 60 seconds. Light/medium pressure Adhere your magnet to the back of your hardboard shape after it has cooled","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xCk7y5OvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martingale Collar Shop","source_asin":"B08J4J9VHP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J4J9VHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J4J9VHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186256,"name":"Now Designs Berry Patch Save It Reusable Cotton Bowl Covers 7.5 and 9.5 inches, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6YCTEYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eliminate the need for plastic wrap or aluminum foil by introducing these reusable bowl covers for leftovers, salads, batter and more. The food safe lining prevents moisture from escaping and keeps food protected and fresh. Because they are reusable, these covers are gentle on your wallet and mother earth. This set includes two matching bowl covers. The smaller bowl cover measures 7.5 inches in diameter and stretches to fit bowls up to 9.25 inches in diameter. The larger cover measures 9.25 inches in diameter and stretches to fit bowls measuring up to 10.75 inches in diameter. They are made from 100 percent cotton with an integrated food-safe lining. Care is simple: machine washable. Made by Now Designs, who for 50 years has designed exclusive home and living decor products with elegance, style and the finest quality in mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P6YCTEYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B08M2VQ4LW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M2VQ4LW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M2VQ4LW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186257,"name":"Floral Shower Curtain Sets with Non-Slip Rugs, Toilet Lid Cover and Bath Mat, Plant Shower Curtain with 12 Hooks, Waterproof Leaf Shower Curtain Sets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wX8GcLqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PERSONALIZED DESIGN】This floral shower curtain sets are designed with botanical leaves pattern, vivid watercolor colors, crisp lines and delicate hemming. 3D digital printing technology, image clearly, bring your bathroom into nature with vitality. Perfect for creating a comfortable lifestyle. 【PREMIUM MATERIAL】The flower shower curtain is made of our carefully selected polyester fabric, waterproof and durable enough to beautify your bathroom, let you enjoy a healthy quality of life. The bathroom mats are made of imitation cashmere plush and TRP bottom, which is comfy, soft, do not fade and quite textured with excellent slip resistance, helping you to enjoy pleasant bath time. 【SIZE INFORMATION】Plant shower curtain size: 70.8\" L x 70.8\" W , the bathroom rug size: 29.5\" L x 18\" W, the toilet lid cover size: 17\" L x 15\" W, the U shape rug size: 20\" L x 18\" W. This size is suitable for most home bathrooms, please confirm whether the size is suitable for you. 【MULTIPLE ENVIRONMENTS】This shower curtain sets with rugs can be easily installed in your home, apartment, hotel, dormitory, club and other places in need. This green shower curtain can also be used to decorate your bathroom, bedroom wall and other places you want to make it pretty. Owning it can make your happy family feel different. 【EASY TO INSTALL & CARE】With our 12 sturdy free hooks, you can easily install this leaf shower curtain to decorate wherever you want to decorate. This waterproof shower curtain can be washed by hand or machine in cold water. Please do not bleach them, it can maintain good looks because of its shrinkage resistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wX8GcLqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GiltGlimmer","source_asin":"B09F9BGXJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F9BGXJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F9BGXJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
