window.products.push({"id":186277,"name":"Artificial Hanging Flowers, Hanging Baskets Fake Hanging Silk Rose Flowers Vine Hanging Plants in Baskets Faux Flowers Hanging Planters for Courtyard ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pyDNXWsOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package Includes】: Including 3 bunches of artificial rose flower vines, 2 cable zip ties and a hanging basket with chain. Note: Maybe the hanging flowers you receive will be wrinkled due to packing squeeze in transit, just blowing them with hot air with a hair dryer for a few minutes will restore them to fullness and flatness. Manually unfold the branches and arrange the flower heads. The flower heads can be disassembled. If the flower heads dropped, you can reinstall it. 【Multiple Uses】: Crafted hanging basket and high-quality artificial rose flower can beautify your corridors, balconies, study rooms, restaurants, courtyard and garden. You can hang it on the wall, doors, swing, mirrors and anywhere as you like to enjoy with artificial flower vine. AND NO MAINTENANCE, WILL NOT WITHER, BLOOM IN ALL SEASONS. 【Size】: 35.43\"length flower, 2.75\"diameter head. Per bunch artificial rose flower have 5 branches,1 longer branches 32.2”, 2 medium branches 30.3”, 2 shorter branches 21.2”. Basket dimensions: 7.87 \" x 7.87\" x 3.94 \"(LxWxH) and the chain length is 15.75 inches. 【Material】: The artificial hanging flower branches are made of high-quality metal wire and plastic. Rose flowers and leaves made of high quality silk. Which is colorful, looks lifelike and has a real touch. looks and feel just like real flowers, Pure natural style, simple and elegant, easy to wash and keep clean. 【Warm Tips】: It is recommended to place in a ventilated space for days to eliminate odor generated during manufacture of plastic product. If you have any question, please contact us via email. We hope you would have a pleasant shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pyDNXWsOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tuyertbik","source_asin":"B097JLT14Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JLT14Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JLT14Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
