window.products.push({"id":186348,"name":"115115 Replacement Filter A for Winx C535, 5300, 6300, 5300-2, P300 Plasma wave, 2 True HEPA Filters Plus 8-Pack Carbon Pre-filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiUUHmzCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compatible with Winx 115115 Size 21 and WAC5300, WAC5500, WAC6300, 5000, 5000b, 5300, 5500, 6300 & 9000. High Quality Product Materials -- This kind of filter can meet the needs of daily life, to be able to help more efficiency to purify your surrounding environment air quality, filtration carbon can not only capture smell, impurities and the surrounding chemicals, it also has a great ability to capture larger particles, such as dust and impurities. Ingenious Design Composition -- Our filter adopts advanced low energy consumption, low density structure, with less pressure to ensure maximum filtration of air, to a large extent to the future environment of life optimization. At the same time, the absorbable activated carbon filter packs have the ability to remove household odors, pet dander, cooking, smoke, sweat that can cause breathing and inhalation problems. Adaptability Of Product Models -- Our filter element is fully compatible with model 5300 6300 5300-2 6300-2 P300 C535 . In numerous filter, we have higher efficiency, durability and the best quality. The filter can let you have a new environmental conditions, and add color to your life. Our filter element is your best alternative. Distinctive Product Advantages -- For the vast majority of filter elements on the market now, the biggest advantage of our products is easy to install, even novice, simple installation tutorial can also let you no longer spend the effort to operate, save time, it is easy to use. At the same time, in order to achieve the best performance of the filter element, it is recommended that you replace the filter element of the purifier every 12 months and the carbon filter every 3 months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CiUUHmzCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reinlichkeit","source_asin":"B09KXTH5X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KXTH5X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KXTH5X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
