window.products.push({"id":186369,"name":"Tribeca Living Twin XL Bed Sheet Set, Soft Cotton Sateen Printed Sheets Floral Print, Extra Deep Pocket, 300 Thread Count, 3-Piece Bedding Sets, Colma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w25i3hVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tribeca Living Bed Sheet Set Immerse yourself into the exquisite softness and luxury of the Tribeca Living bed sheets. High-quality, premium bedding in an array of colors and prints for every decor. Our high thread count bed sheets 300-thread feature a floral or paisley print design. Durably soft and comfortable, just right for year-round use and every season, these printed cotton sateen sheets feature a smooth weave with a luminous finish. With the feel of satin bed sheets and the comfort of cotton bed sheets, these premium bed sheets are ideal for those looking for luxury. Sheet Set Includes: The 4-piece bed sheet includes one flat sheet, one fitted sheet, and two standard pillowcases (one in Twin and Twin XL). The fully elasticized deep pocket fitted sheet can accommodate mattresses up to 22\" deep. Machine washable. Sizes: Bed Sheet Set California King: Cal King flat sheet measures 112 inches x 106 inches. Cal King fitted sheet measures 72 inches x 84 inches. Each king pillowcase measures 20 x 40 inches. Bed Sheet Set King: King Flat sheet measures 112 inches x 106 inches. King Fitted Sheet measures 78 inches x 80 inches. Each standard pillowcase measures 20 x 40 inches. Bed Sheet Set Queen: Queens flat sheet measures 94 inches x 106 inches. Queen fitted sheet measures 60 inches x 80 inches. Each standard pillowcase measures 20 x 30 inches. Bed Sheet Set Twin: Twin Flat sheet measures 66 inches x 94 inches. Twin Fitted Sheet measures 54 inches x 75 inches. Each standard pillowcase measures 20 x 30 inches. Bed Sheet Twin XL: Twin XL Flat sheet measures 66 inches x 102 inches. Twin XL Fitted Sheet measures 39 inches x 80 inches. Each standard pillowcase measures 20 x 30 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81w25i3hVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribeca Living","source_asin":"B07DQ2JFVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DQ2JFVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DQ2JFVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186370,"name":"Clever Creations 15 Inch Pre Lit Tabletop Ceramic Christmas Tree, Hand Painted Holiday Decoration with Multicolored Lights, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CRir20QLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄 LIGHT UP CHRISTMAS TREE: This tabletop ceramic tree is sure to bring the Christmas spirit into your home with its unique, hand-painted look and bright multicolored lightbulbs 🎄 HIGH QUALITY DESIGN: Made of light, yet durable heat-resistant ceramic and hand painted with a glossy finish 🎄 PERFECT SIZE: This tabletop christmas tree measures approximately 8\" L x 8\" W x 15\" H; Fits most spaces and looks great with any Christmas décor 🎄MINIMAL ASSEMBLY REQUIRED: This battery operated miniature tree can be assembled in less than 5 minutes; Package includes 1 lamp, 1 ceramic tree, and 1 star topper 🎄 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We at Clever Creations make only the finest home goods of the highest quality; For that reason, customer satisfaction is very important to us and we strive to offer the widest variety of quality products backed by our 100% money back satisfaction guarantee so you can buy with confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CRir20QLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clever Creations","source_asin":"B0942M1ZVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0942M1ZVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0942M1ZVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186371,"name":"Aerolatte Milk Frother, The Original Steam-Free Frother, Satin Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31v64j7dh3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Aerolatte’s Original Steam-Free Milk Frother with a Satin Finish aerates milk into a thick, rich foamy beverage anywhere. Frothed milk is fun and easy to make with very little effort. The frother is easy for everyone to use, requires no electricity, and is more compact and economical than espresso machines. Easily froth all types of milk, from whole, skim or Goat milk, to hemp, almond, soy, cashew, coconut, and other non dairy milk. Simply measure chilled or warmed milk into a mug or glass. Submerge the whisk end of the frother, then press and hold the power button to create a creamy, silky froth on top, about 30-60 seconds or until desired consistency is achieved. Serve and enjoy. Add flavorings before frothing, if desired. It makes afternoon snack time more fun and is a great addition to coffee accessories to transform fresh-brewed coffee into specialty Coffee drinks. Great for cappuccino, cafe au Latte, caramel macchiato, mocha, Irish Coffee or iced coffee. Elevate hot chocolate from ordinary to extraordinary or finish craft cocktails with panache. Made from 18/8 stainless steel and plastic with a Satin Finish that’s lead, cadmium, phthalates, and BPA free to be Prop 65 compliant, Aerolatte’s milk frother to go is durable, versatile, and easy to use. Hand wash the frother’s whisk end in warm, soapy water. Includes milk frother and batteries. Amazon.com This cute handheld milk frother is fun and easy to use; British celebrity chef Nigella Lawson recommends it over steam-driven frothers. Plus, in addition to its most popular use--creating delicate foam for homemade cappuccinos, lattes, or hot chocolates-- the Aerolatte milk frother can be used for other, equally yummy treats. An enclosed recipe sheet offers ideas for fruit \"shakes\" and coffee frappes that can be made with any kind of cow, goat, sheep, soy or rice milk! Some restaurant chefs even froth milk to foam garnish earthy soups. The frother is easy to use, with a simple black toggle button to turn it on. Hold the stainless steel head just below foam level to keep froth building. The shape of the steel-toned, satin-finished handle is curved in the right places and flattened on the sides for a comfortable grip. When it's time to replace the batteries, a black ridged cover slides off to reveal the battery chamber. (Its important to use alkaline batteries with the Aerolatte milk frother.) To clean, turn the frother on and dip the whisk in hot soapy water; rinse well, and turn again briefly to spin dry. Wipe the handle with a damp cloth; do not immerse handle in water. The whisk is not removable from the battery handle. The milk frother measures 8-1/2 by 1-1/2 inches. Two AA alkaline batteries are included, as well as a recipe and instruction sheet. Aerolatte guarantees the Original Steam-Free frother for five years. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31v64j7dh3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aerolatte","source_asin":"B07MGHRRKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MGHRRKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MGHRRKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
