window.products.push({"id":186426,"name":"Minimalist Stainless Steel Toilet Brush and Round Holder Set- Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EwjyVzWiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This chic product makes a bold statement in the bathroom in hot pink. Coming in a rust proof and scratch proof stainless steel finish for both the toilet brush and its holder, this set is not just eye-catching, but surprisingly functional as well. The glossy finish of the pink paint repels water, saving you from the nasty water stains that form on bare brushed stainless steel. This helps in maintaining that neat, tidy and sterile aesthetic that you've always wanted in your toilet! The short brushed stainless steel accent at the easy-to-hold handle of the brush lends a quirky whimsical feel to the whole piece while maintaining design harmony! This modernly cute combo is not just decorative, but elegantly camp! Made of stainless steel for rust and scratch resistant aesthetic!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EwjyVzWiL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JustNile","source_asin":"B01MT3COKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT3COKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT3COKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
