window.products.push({"id":186469,"name":"TOPSKY Computer Desk 59’’ Large Desktop Surface with Additional 3-Tier Bookshelves, 1-Tier Storage Shelf and Keyboard Tray for Office (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jBh8Ah3PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOPSKY CT-3337A: 1 year warranty and suitable for office use. ※All of Synthetic wood furniture in TOPSKY were using CARB P2 Class board. Spacious Desktop Surface: The assembled desk size including the 3-tier side shelve is 59.1’’ (L) x23.6’’ (W) x47.2’’ (H). You can make full use of the entire desktop surface without obstruction of shelves. 47.2’’x23.6’’ desktop can fulfill your daily demand for computer desk to accommodate your monitors, documents, lamp and other work supplies. And the surface is smooth and easy for cleaning. Multi-Functional Design: This compact but spacious desk is in 3-in-1 design, perfect combination of computer desk, 3-tier side bookshelf and under-desk storage shelf. It can be served as computer desk, writing desk, gaming desk or other workstation and helps to keep everything organized and tidy. And the position of side shelf and under-desk shelf can be exchanged by adjusting the position of cross structure. Ample Storage Space: In addition to the desk surface, the extra attached 3-tier side shelf, under-desk shelf and keyboard tray provides ample storage room without taking up any desktop space. You can put books, documents, plants, printer or CPU on the shelves. And keyboard tray is ideal for accommodating big keyboard and mouse. To achieve this, the leg room may be a little limited. You can increase 0.9’’ leg height by adjusting the feet pad or remove the keyboard tray if you don’t need. Sturdy Structure: Constructed with high quality synthetic board and heavy-duty iron frame, the desk is durable and solid to hold 200lbs weight and the 3-tier side shelf can bear about 30lbs weight capacity. The cross structure also provides great support to the frame and enhances the stability of the desk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jBh8Ah3PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPSKY","source_asin":"B08GS2BY1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GS2BY1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GS2BY1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
