window.products.push({"id":186480,"name":"ASOCO Marble Pink Tapestry Blue Modern Decoration Abstract Wall Tapestry Colorful Watercolor Grey Gouache Wall Hanging Decor Multicolor for Dorm Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZM2-RsZeS._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Go for a dramatic makeover of your wall,pink blue and grey modern tapestry would become a piece of art. A must have in any season. This is a rare beauty not to be missed, a genuine collector item showing the result of masterly workmanship. Specification: Size: 80X60 Inch(200X150cm)Material:Polyester fiber, comfortable, durable, soft and skin-friendly.The dye for the design is one side only,the other side is white. Usages: Brighten up any space with this beautiful wall hanging, college dorm DIY decorating. It's also a surprise gift at housewarmings, special holiday and birthdays. really brings your room to life. It is perfect for a wall hanging, tablecloth, beach forts, dorm room, window curtain or other room idea. It can also be used in different ways to decor home like as bed spread, tapestry, bed cover. How to Care for Your Tapestry? 1. Hand Wash / Cold Water / Hang Dry. 2. Do NOT use bleach. 3. Remove directly after cycle. 4. Dry flat or hang to dry in a shaded area. 5. Low temperature ironing.6. Do NOT hang in direct sunlight for long time. Notice: 1.Because of the unique and handmade nature the measurements above may differ a small bit from the real one.2.Actual colors may vary from those shown due to the nature of photographing and monitor color settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZM2-RsZeS._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASOCO","source_asin":"B0932Z7D2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0932Z7D2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0932Z7D2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186481,"name":"Touchless Soap Dispenser, Wall Mount Automatic Soap Dispenser, Motion Sensor Pump Battery Powered Hand Sanitizer Dispenser for Gel/Liquid (S02 - 600ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T9xIyiPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PAY ATTENTION PLEASE: 1. NO particles included 2.Thick or chemical corrosive lotion liquid is more likely to cause clog 3.Test with water before fill your liquid in. Troubleshooting: 1. Power: Ensure properly power supply.2. Sensor: Does the sensor light work? The sensor has a sound? If all is yes, the machine's components are good.3. Liquid outlet: The product can only put liquid like household dishwashing liquid. It must be a liquid that can flow freely.Liquid like a gel will easily cause a clogging of the liquid outlet tube so that liquid could not come out. How to solve? (1) Pour out the original liquid soap.(2) Dilute your liquid soap with water, warm water can be used too.(3) Dredge the liquid outlet pipe with a thimble. Notes: 1. Do not install the dispenser with less than 2\" (5cm) height beneath the table. 2. The sensor is at the base of dispenser. The effect range is 0-10cm underneath the sensor. 3. This dispenser is design for indoor use only. Direct sunlight or exposed locations can destroy the IR sensor of the product.4. Low voltage indicator when you find LED light twinkle continually while dispenser on standby mode, battery replace is necessary.5. Do not use the alcohol or other chemistry liquid.6. This product doesn't have waterproof function, please place product far from dampness. Specification: Type: Wall-Mounted Soap DispenserMaterial: ABS, ASQuantity: 1 pc Max Capacity: 600ml Drop Volume: 0.8-1ml Effect Distance: 0-10cmBattery: 4*1.5V AA battery (not included)Static Current: 60uARated Current: 200mASize: 11*12.8*13.2cm / 4.3*5*5.2\" Net Weight: 0.36kg / 12.7oz","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T9xIyiPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S SUNSBELL","source_asin":"B01EYBDBOW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EYBDBOW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EYBDBOW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
