window.products.push({"id":186483,"name":"Wamife Slow Masticating Juicer Machine, Cold Press Juicer Extractor, 2 Modes & Reverse Function for High Nutrient Fruit & Vegetable Juice, Quiet Motor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lEYL494lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍊【92% Juice Yield & Pure Juice】Masticating juicers can perfectly separate pomace and juice, providing you with the purest juice and vitamins. Not only can Wamife cold press juicer extract up to 92% pure juice without adding water, the low-speed motor also reduces oxidation, providing rich nutrients and good taste. 🍅【Upgraded Auger】Wamife vegetable and fruit juicer has upgraded the auger to 8 spirals, which effectively improves the juice yield rate and reduces the need for disassembly of the ingredients or uneven juice output due to sticking. From fruits to veggies it cuts your time spent on prep in half if not more. 🥕【2 Modes & Reverse Function】Our compact slow press juicer with 2 modes can extract various vegetables and fruits. Soft Mode: orange, grape, berry, etc. Hard Mode: apple, carrot, celery, kale, etc. Also, long-press the reverse button for 2-3 seconds to solve the stuck problem. You can enjoy delicious juice more easily. 🍈【One-Button Disassemble & Easy to Clean】One-button assemble and disassemble design saves your time on juicing and cleaning. All detachable parts are made of high-quality food-grade materials. The bonus cleaning brush makes cleaning easier. Choose our juicer machine to achieve 5 seconds convenient and quick rinse! 🍓【Practical & Safe Design】Compact structure and anti dripping valves prevent juice from dripping when you don’t need it. Small feeder chute prevent you from being injured when juicing. Intelligent motor protection chips can make the juicer extractor stop automatically for every 20 mins operation, which ensures a longer service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lEYL494lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wamife","source_asin":"B09XB4VR7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB4VR7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB4VR7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
