window.products.push({"id":186533,"name":"Senalife Certified 100% Organic Cotton & Organic Dye Prewashed XL (76x37 inc)- Very Softly - Original Turkish Bath Towels - Loincloth Turkish Beach To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712gbprmuWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Senalife Turkish Bath Towel Features Senalife Turkish beach towels It is made of 100% cotton. White and natural models can wash up to 70 degrees. No problem. It can wash up to 30 and 40 degrees in colored models. It is strictly forbidden to use softener because the water-absorbing pores of the product are closed. (Note: Peshtamal sellers do not warn you to use softeners.The softener used in loincloths prevents the loincloth from drying and absorbing water quickly, which causes the product to be used and wear out) only the colors need to be washed in the washing machine one at a time (separately). It can then wash as desired in mixed colors. absolutely does not pull. As you can see in the photos, our products are not ironed. Ironed products will not absorb water. If you want to iron, avoid direct contact with the loincloth and iron it by placing a thick towel between it. Warranty period 1 year at least as manufacturer. to be covered by warranty In case of color fading and water absorption, it will be returned instantly. It is covered by warranty in case of rupture. You will not like any other towel or loincloth after this loincloth, which can be used in the beach, bath and pool instead of towels at home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712gbprmuWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senalife","source_asin":"B08X2YZHMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X2YZHMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X2YZHMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186534,"name":"Milk Spout 1 of A Kind Kitchen Gadget - Easy Open Spout, Fast Seal, Amazing Tool For Arthritic Hands, Provides Smooth Clean Pour With Less Spills and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9UkTVLWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Milk in twist-off cap containers is pretty convenient, but wouldn't you love to have a dollar for every time you twisted those caps on and off? Jokari has come up with a clever little gadget that lets you untwist that cap once and throw it away! The push-and-pour milk spout slips firmly into the mouth of most plastic milk, juice or water jugs for a smooth, no-drip pour every time. And, when you've filled those glasses, the spout snaps closed to seal in freshness. It's great for anyone with arthritis, too. Thanks Jokari! For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From their exclusive collection of Paula Deen storage and organization solutions to unique kitchen gadgets and Healthy Steps portion control kitchen tools, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, colorful and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9UkTVLWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B071HX5L2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HX5L2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HX5L2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
