window.products.push({"id":186580,"name":"CleverMade Premium Soft Sided Malibu Cooler-Tote; Spacious Top Compartment and 12 Can Insulated Leakproof Cooler Bottom; Made From Recycled Materials,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WngphBW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CleverMade Premium Soft Sided Malibu Cooler Tote is the perfect style solution for anyone on the go. It has a spacious zippered top compartment that is perfect for dry storage along with a bottom compartment that is insulated and leakproof making it an awesome cooler! The best part is that this cooler is a friend to the environment. It is made from recycled materials, equivalent to 6 plastic bottles so it is a purchase you can feel good about. This premium bag is ideal for any occasion. Use it as a lunch box at work and put your food and drinks in the cooler part with ice or ice packs and your other work supplies in the top dry compartment. Use it at the beach as a cooler and towel holder. You can even use it on a road trip and place a pair of shoes in the bottom compartment and extra clothes in the top. The frame is sturdy enough to stand on its own making packing a breeze! The long straps are comfortable and ideal to use over the shoulder for heavy loads or by the hand for easy toting. The CleverMade Malibu Cooler Tote measures out to 17.72\" L x 8.66\" W x 13.39\" H and weights 1.59 lbs. when empty. The weight capacity is 30 lbs. and it can fit 12 cans of your favorite beverage in the bottom. Ideal for men and women on the go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WngphBW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CleverMade","source_asin":"B0BG92CTCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG92CTCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG92CTCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186581,"name":"The Estate Swing 12 Foot Long, Single Driveway Gate - Black E-SG 12S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8mOY-eCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Length: 12 feet, 2 inches long Height: 5 feet on sides, 6 feet at the apex From the innovative brand Estate Swing known for its dependable gate automation comes the new eye catching and affordable Estate Swing Driveway Gate Collection. With an elegant sweeping arc and clean lines this single 12 foot long gate is functional both in its appearance and in regard to automation. The design incorporates classic artistry, sturdy wrought aluminum alloy and a smooth powder coated finish. Unlike other gates where automation is a secondary thought, Estate Swing recognized the need for operator placement from the start; therefore customer automation preferences were considered beforehand which ultimately prevents awkward looking and structurally unsound flat bars from being added later on. Additionally, by using wrought aluminum as the base metal instead of steel it creates a stronger lighter weight gate, which in turn, is safer for people and objects as well as benefits the operator motor since it puts less strain on the gears. As gate automation professionals, Estate Swing sought to anticipate the needs of consumers and incorporate those details when designing this dynamic driveway gate. It’s easy to drill, easy to lift, easy to automate which keeps both the DIY installation effort and cost down significantly. Only as an afterthought will other gate manufactures add on narrow, structurally unsound flat bars to attach the operator - which negatively affects the gates overall structural integrity. Either the bars become loose which puts uneven pressure on the opener as it retracts (scraping the paint and striping away at the core metal). Or if it does stay in place, that plate is bolted to only 2 or 3 pickets leaving those few narrow pickets to uphold the weight, movement and pressure of the opener. ******Could take up to 4 weeks for fabrication.**","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8mOY-eCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Estate Swiing","source_asin":"B005D7YFK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005D7YFK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005D7YFK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186582,"name":"Tea Kettle -2.2 Quart Tea Kettles Stovetop Whistling Teapot Stainless Steel Tea Pots for Stove Top Whistle Tea Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jQweA-jeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This LUXGRACE 2.2 quarts whistling stainless steel stovetop kettle is crafted of high quality stainless steel. Whistles when boiling, can be used on gas, electric, induction, halogen, and radiant stovetops. The tea pot heats up quickly and retains heat well. Encapsulated bottom provides even heat distribution. Convenient trigger mechanism on the handle allows for the safe and easy pour. Removable lid for easy filling and convenient one finger flip spout for easy and safe pouring.The metallic color on the kettle body, this sophisticated design tea pot is also perfect embellishment for your kitchen. Features: Material: Stainless steel Capacity: 2.2quarts Whistle: Yes Heat Proof Handle Stainless Steel Spout Trigger on handle to open or close the flip up spout cover Stove Type Compatibility: Gas; Electric; Induction; Halogen, and Radiant Stovetops Fill water both through the spout or remove the lid to fill water 10 colors available Caution: Clean the kettle before use DO NOT heat the empty kettle, it could be very dangerous When use on a gas stove, DO NOT let the flame burn the kettle body, better keep flame under the kettle bottom We do not recommend fill water above the spout, the whistle doesn't work and it adds the risk of overflow when the water boils Althought the handle is heat proof, we still recommend to wait 5-10 seconds before you lift the kettle or use a potholder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jQweA-jeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXGRACE","source_asin":"B092CB4TRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092CB4TRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092CB4TRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
