window.products.push({"id":186596,"name":"12PCS Stackable Drawer Organizer and Storage, Versatile Large Utensil Tray Drawer Organizers Bins for Clothes/Kitchen/Bathroom/Office/Makeup, Colorful","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RKDVM-kPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stackable Drawer Organizer: Different size drawer organizers which you can customize the layout to fit any size drawer or specific need. Separate pieces can be split up or stackable for different uses and drawers. Multipurpose Drawer Dividers: The desk drawer organizer will keep your accessories neat, tidy, and organized. Perfect drawer inserts for kitchen drawer organizer, makeup drawer organizer, office drawer organizer, bathroom drawer organizer, and silverware drawer organizer. Set of 12 Customize Layout: Perfect for dresser/bathroom/kitchen/office drawers, organizing cosmetics, makeup tools, hair accessories, nail polish, jewelry, toothpaste, hairbrushes, medicine, silverware, office supplies, etc. 100% Food Grade Material: Made of eco-friendly plastic(PP), BPA-free, and unbreakable. The multicolored divider design makes it easy to see and find each item quickly. Easy to Care: Durable, long-lasting plastic and rounded corners design make the drawer trays easy to wipe clean (or hand-wash with soap and water).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RKDVM-kPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IYOOH","source_asin":"B08CMZ6YX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CMZ6YX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CMZ6YX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186597,"name":"Mora Ceramic Large Mixing Bowls - Set of 2 Nesting Bowls for Cooking, Serving, Popcorn, Salad etc - Microwavable Kitchen Stoneware, Oven, Microwave an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51U41cxYIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IT’S TIME TO HIT PAUSE AND EAT: This is more than a bowl. Mora is Latin for \"Pause\", acting as a reminder to slow down in your amazing life. You are always being told to do more, to go faster, to be better, but it's time for you to slow down every once in a while and hit pause. Your Mora bowls can help you do that. No matter what you are eating, every time you use a Mora bowl it is a reminder to hit pause, give yourself some family time, and practice mindful eating. STORAGE FRIENDLY NESTING: Our mixing bowls are designed with you in mind. Combine this set with our larger set to get a beautiful set of four mixing bowls for every kitchen need. See pictures below. CRYSTALLIZED SCRATCH RESISTANT FORMULA: Our glaze is extra strong to prevent scratches from your knives and forks. Only we produce a crystallized glossy glaze that is strong enough to resist scratches under 1000 grams of pressure. Please note dark marks may occur due to finish on certain silverware, which are not scratches, but metal residue marks. To remove metallic stains, use Bar Keeper's Friend. CERAMIC WITH 20% STRONGER PALADIN CLAY: Only we have Paladin Clay which is 20% stronger than the competitors, giving you stronger and more durable stoneware. Our clay has optimal heat retention to keep your food hotter longer, and can handle over 500 degrees F. Dishwasher safe and mother approved. MORA’S PROMISE: We provide a free refund or replacement for any defective products, anytime. Just let us know what happened. We offer daily customer service because you are important to us. Our objective is to help you hit pause, so we won’t settle for anything you don’t love. We’re not happy unless you are.❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51U41cxYIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MORA CERAMICS HIT PAUSE","source_asin":"B09S7YKPSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S7YKPSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S7YKPSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
