window.products.push({"id":186729,"name":"2020 NEW18pcs No Damage Wall Hangers Removable Adhesive Sticky Wall Hooks Heavy Duty for Hanging Multipurpose Coat Rack Hook Set for Kitchen, Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpTIzY0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The combination of our hooks is specially designed for family use scenes and contains 3 kinds of hooks. Snap button: especially suitable for items without hanging holes, such as tissue boxes, power connectors, and various utensils Coat hook: This is a traditional hook, especially suitable for hanging coats and hats, handbags, bath balls, and various cooking utensils in the kitchen, as long as you like, you can hang all the items in life Plug hook: especially suitable for mounting power plugs and data cables. It can also be used as a razor holder, toothbrush holder, and bath ball in the bathroom. It can even be used as a phone holder Color: transparent Material: PC+ABS Packing quantity: 1 pack 18 hooks Size: 2.76*2.76 in 2.36 *2.36in how to install: Step1: Before installing the adhesive hook, please make sure the surface is clean, dry, free of dust and oil, and wipe it dry first. Step2: Remove the transparent film on the back of the hook, paste it on any smooth surface, and press it firmly to remove any bubbles. Step3: Adhesion will become maximum after 12 hours. prompt: 1. Do not mount overweight, expensive or fragile products. 2. Do not use in a high temperature environment (not more than 60 degrees), suitable for all kinds of smooth surfaces, such as tiles, marble, glass, stainless steel, wood, metal or plastic. 3. Our wall hook is very sticky, do not use it on the wall that is easy to peel off. Not suitable for cement walls, wallpaper, paint, painted walls and rough surfaces, and may damage these walls 4. Maximum load: 25 pounds. However, we recommend that long-term mounting does not exceed 15 pounds. Removal method: heat with a hair dryer, then slowly take it out from the side","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PpTIzY0GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUKYCN","source_asin":"B08NDB35FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NDB35FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NDB35FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
