window.products.push({"id":186796,"name":"U-Taste 18/8 Stainless Steel 16 inch Adjustable Rolling Pin with Silicone Removable Thickness Rings, Nonstick Kitchen Roller Pin for Baking Cookies Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rww56LyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Not just make it, we upgrade it] We are a professional kitchenware producer who have been focus on customer experience. In order to offer better and eco-friendly kitchenware, U-Taste collects customer reviews of all similar products on Amazon. And then upgrade the products based on the data of the bad evaluation with the aim to provide customers with more perfect kitchenware products. [Removable Rings to Adjust Height] There are 4 sizes of detachable rings to the expected thickness easily and professionally -- 1/16in(2mm), 1/6in(4mm), 1/4in(6mm), 3/8in(10mm). They raise the rolling surface by different amounts to create exactly the required pastry thickness. Simply take the rings down and put on the new rings for specific thickness. The food grade silicone allows for safe contact with food. [4 Rings with Arc Groove] With arc groove in the thickness ring, they can be used as a stand for the roller to avoid falling off the counter. We notice that the sound of metal on stone may annoy you and U-Taste don't want that to happen on our steel rolling pin, so we found the rings with arc groove design. Simple place the roller on after using. No loud noise and no falling off issues. [Anti-rust 18/8 stainless steel] No one wants their dough to mix with rust stains, that’s why the rust-proof 18/8 stainless steel would be our choice. It’s safe with food touch, no more worries about corroding. No painting will chip off and no smell will transfer to the dough because it’s bare stainless steel! Easy to put the rings on and take them off for cleaning by hand or use the dishwasher. No hustle, no troubles. [Engraved Measurement and Seamless Design] Easy to read with clear engraved measurement on it and never wash off over time. You can roll the dough whatever the size you need. The one-piece seamless design makes sure that the water will not seep into the rolling pin. The 16in length is suitable for nearly all baking tasks. You can leave them in the fridge to keep it cool and nonstick to roll out your dough. A great gift for the bakers to make tortellini, pasta, pie crust, pizza dough and cookies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rww56LyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B08RMYL36C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RMYL36C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RMYL36C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":186797,"name":"Pacific Cotton Sateen Bed Sheet Set – Luxury Soft Breathable Cotton Bedding Set with Deep-Pocket Fitted Sheet, Flat Sheet + 2 Pillow Cases – 300 Threa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718h6aF2gpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AFFORDABLE LUXURY: At Pacific Cotton Co, we create luxurious yet affordable sheets. This collection of 300 thread count cotton sheet sets focuses on life's simple pleasures at a price you can get behind. The deep pocket fitted sheet features high-quality, sturdy elastic for a snug fit that can easily fit standard-sized beddings and mattresses. FULL SIZE SATEEN SHEETS SET 300 THREAD COUNT: Our 4-piece full size sateen sheets set includes: 1 Flat Sheet (81\" W x 96\" L), 2 Pillowcases (21\" W x 27\" L), and 1 Fitted Sheet (54\" W x 75\" L) with a pocket depth of up to 17 inches. The deep pocket fitted sheet features high-quality, sturdy elastic for a snug fit that can easily fit standard-sized bedding and mattresses. Our sateen bed sheets are available in several elegant hues and sizes â€œ twin, full, queen, and king. EASY TO CARE, FADE-RESISTANT, LONG LASTING: Our cotton sheets are long lasting and will not fade after multiple washes. The pillowcases will retain their smoothness while the flat sheet will continue to give you restful sleep, night after night, without compromising feel or softness. The sateen bed sheet set is machine washable (tumble dry). Infact, our sheets only get softer with every wash. MADE WITH SOCIALLY RESPONSIBLE PRACTICES: At Pacific Cotton, we pride ourselves in manufacturing our cotton sheets in line with the core tenets of transparency, sustainability, and integrity. We pay our craftsmen and women fair wages, provide education, health care & economic opportunity. All our bed sheets are STANDARD 100 certified by OEKO-TEX.  We weave together socially conscious business practices and technical expertise to elevate the lives of the people we touch. COLOR: Products color may slightly differ in real life depending on the light exposure. NATURALLY COOLING, ALLERGY FRIENDLY: Our sheets are naturally cooling due to the quality of the cotton we use. All of our pure, sustainable cotton sheet sets are certified and guaranteed to be free of harmful chemicals, making the 300 thread count sheet sets soft, luxurious and allergy-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718h6aF2gpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Cotton","source_asin":"B0BLSP25G4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-186797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSP25G4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSP25G4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
